---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import Spoons from '../components/Spoons.astro';
import ProductCard from '../components/ProductCard.astro';
import NewsletterCTA from '../components/NewsletterCTA.astro';
import {products} from '../data/products';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
---
<Layout title="Two people. Two spoons. One delicious adventure." description="Meet Two Spoons: a father–daughter gluten-free food adventure in Haymarket, Virginia. Cookies, banana bread, seasoning blends, and a whole lot of heart.">
  <section class="home-hero"><div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy"><span class="intro-label">GLUTEN-FREE, BECAUSE IT’S PERSONAL</span><h1>Two spoons.<br/>One big dream.<br/><em>Good food.</em></h1><p>We’re a dad and daughter building the gluten-free pantry we wish our family had: food made with the care, flavor, and clarity that everyone deserves at the table.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/pantry">Meet our pantry <Icon size={18}/></a><a class="text-link" href="/our-story">Our family story <Icon size={17}/></a></div><span class="hero-smallprint"><Icon name="heart" size={13}/> Built with love in Haymarket, Virginia.</span></div>
    <div class="hero-art"><img class="hero-image" src={withBase('/images/hero-pantry-spread.webp')} alt="Illustrated gluten-free pantry spread with banana bread, seasoning jars, and chocolate chip cookies" width="1440" height="1080" fetchpriority="high"/><span class="hero-sparkle" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p class="photo-caption">Illustrated first-batch serving ideas.</p></div>
  </div></section>
  <div class="value-strip"><div class="container"><span><Icon name="heart" size={17}/> Family at the heart</span><span class="divider" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span><Icon name="leaf" size={17}/> Gluten-free in the making</span><span class="divider" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span><Icon name="sun" size={17}/> Big on everyday joy</span><span class="divider" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span><Icon name="pin" size={17}/> Rooted in Virginia</span></div></div>
  <section class="section pantry-preview"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow text-orange">GOOD THINGS START IN THE KITCHEN</span><h2>Meet your future<br/><em>pantry favorites.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/pantry">Explore the pantry <Icon size={17}/></a></div><div class="product-grid">{products.map(product=><ProductCard product={product}/>)}</div><p class="illustration-note">Our first recipes are still taking shape. Explore the ideas, or send an order request and we’ll confirm the details with you.</p></div></section>
  <section class="family-section"><div class="container family-grid"><div class="family-art" aria-label="Illustration of two smiling spoons, one for dad and one for daughter"><Spoons faces={true}/><span class="family-label dad-label">the dad</span><span class="family-label daughter-label">the daughter</span><span class="family-heart" aria-hidden="true">♡</span><span class="family-caption">a pretty good pair, if you ask us.</span></div><div class="family-copy"><span class="eyebrow">THE TWO BEHIND THE SPOONS</span><h2>Some family stories<br/>start with<br/><em>“pass me a spoon.”</em></h2><p>Ours did. A father, a daughter, and a kitchen counter full of possibilities. We started cooking together, chasing that “you have to try this” kind of delicious. Now we’re building something we can share with you.</p><p>This is our little adventure. We’d love you to be part of it.</p><a class="text-link" href="/our-story">A little more about us <Icon size={18}/></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="personal-note"><div class="container"><div><span class="eyebrow">WHY GLUTEN-FREE MATTERS HERE</span><h2>This is food for <em>our family, too.</em></h2></div><div><p>A close family member lives with celiac disease. Amaya and her mom also navigate gluten sensitivity. That experience shapes every recipe we develop: we want the food on our table to feel generous, familiar, and worth looking forward to.</p><a class="text-link" href="/our-approach">How we’re approaching it <Icon size={18}/></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="text-center"><span class="eyebrow text-orange">OUR RECIPE FOR SOMETHING GOOD</span><h2>More than what’s <em>in the bag.</em></h2></div><div class="values-grid"><div class="value-item"><span class="value-icon"><Icon name="leaf" size={27}/></span><h3>Thoughtful from the start.</h3><p>We’re developing our recipes with gluten-free ingredients and clear labeling in mind. Good food begins with care.</p></div><div class="value-item"><span class="value-icon"><Icon name="heart" size={27}/></span><h3>Made of family.</h3><p>Recipe dreaming, taste-testing, and big decisions. We’re building this side by side, with two spoons and plenty of opinions.</p></div><div class="value-item"><span class="value-icon"><Icon name="sun" size={27}/></span><h3>For real, everyday life.</h3><p>Slow breakfasts. Quick dinners. A handful on the way out. We’re making room for more little moments of delicious.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <NewsletterCTA/>
</Layout>
